BT 1 0 0 1 6 323 Tm  T* ET
0 0 0 rg
BT /F4 7.8 Tf 9.36 TL ET
BT 1 0 0 1 6 313.2 Tm (s = socket.socket\(socket.AF_PACKET, socket.SOCK_RAW, socket.ntohs\(3\)\)) Tj T* ET
